if (loadParam != null && !loadParam.IsReadOnly)
    loadParam.Set(occupancyLoad);
```

This computed occupancy load then feeds into other BCL rules:
- Egress width: `exit_width >= occupancy_load * 0.2.inches_per_person`
- Fixture counts: `wc_count >= ceiling(occupancy_load / ratio)`
- Exit count: `if occupancy_load > 500: exits >= 3`

